        "proof_chain": "The definition 004X puts the generic point x in every nonempty open chart of irreducible X. Therefore D000324 turns local immersion somewhere into the generic stalk surjectivity criterion and conversely gives the chart at x. For clause (ii) 01RM identifies y generic with dominance and 01RO identifies y generic plus the local-ring isomorphism with birationality. The literal proof again uses D000324; independently 01TX followed by 0BAC gives the stronger isomorphism on dense nonempty opens.",
