        "proof_chain": "Tag 01K3 is the exact modern form of the source definition. A quasi-compact open is a finite union of members of any quasi-compact open basis so basiswise inverse-image testing is equivalent to the definition; 01K4 states and proves the affine-basis specialization and the finite-affine-union form. For the affine-target example D000267 and item four of 01SG make every affine-chart inverse image affine and 01K4 concludes. Restriction to an open target and descent from an arbitrary target open cover are the two directions of 01K4 after affine refinement.",
